# apps/api/cron/crontab — deploy scheduler for the API's daily jobs
# (issues.md: "o fechamento do mês no cartão o sistema deve fazer
# automaticamente" — the job existed but nothing ever invoked it). Installed
# into the `cron` service (docker-compose.prod.yml) via entrypoint.sh.
#
# Times are in America/Sao_Paulo (TZ set on the container, see
# docker-compose.prod.yml) — the project's canonical timezone for date logic
# (ARQUITETURA.md §0). Staggered 5 minutes apart so they never overlap on a
# slow migration/cold start.
0 3 * * * cd /app && npm run job:fulfillment --workspace=@lurem/api >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
5 3 * * * cd /app && npm run job:invoice-events --workspace=@lurem/api >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
10 3 * * * cd /app && npm run job:usage-rollup --workspace=@lurem/api >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
